title: 'to Doc: whether a person who is not Jeff could start using skg from the docs is the one part of the case for skg nobody has tested.'
pid: f03ea9fb-cf13-4926-acb5-6ab1e4d2a468
body: |2-
  I could start from my home note in six requests, but I am not a
  person and never open an editor. What I hope from you: a reading of
  'docs/' as that person would read it on their first day, saying where
  they would stop. My note:
  [[id:76f0f9cd-0c55-4dc0-9ccc-2fb908042396][The case for skg is clearest where I stand]].
